id: all-out-start
name: All-Out Start
talentCategory: starter
prerequisites: Jump Start
description: >
  As soon as you decide to take the fight seriously, you unleash your full power, holding nothing back.
text: >
  All-Out Start: As soon as you decide to take the fight seriously, you unleash your full power, holding nothing back.
  –Prerequisites: Jump Start
  (1)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Encounter]: Use the Transformation Maneuver immediately as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Encounter]: Increase your Soak Value and Combat Rolls by 1(bT) for 2 Combat Rounds.

---

# (1) On your turn's card, ticked - never Automatic, it hands over an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver: the Transformation out of
# sequence (chat.mjs allOutTransform).
[triggered/start-of-turn, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 1]
allOutTransform();

# (2) Entering the Encounter: All-Out (a mark) - Soak Value and Combat Rolls 1(bT) - through its second Combat Round, gone as
# the third begins or the Encounter ends (chat.mjs allOutStart; combat.mjs). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic
# button.
[triggered/start-of-encounter, effect 2]
allOutStart();
